  "comments": "Counterfeits can by identified by privy marks, punctuation and orientation:<br /><br />\r\nAll Everson Types 1 and 3 for Maltravers have a die axis of 0° (medal alignment), as do all Type 2 except those with privy marks double rose and woolpack.<br />\r\nThe only genuine privy marks for Type 1 are double rose and woolpack.<br />\r\nType 1 never has a stop after BRIT.<br />\r\nGenuine Maltravers farthings are well-centred.",
